7. Figure F6. End-to-End System Sequence Diagram
text


sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Rec as Receptionist
    actor Doc as Doctor
    actor Tech as Lab Tech
    actor Pharm as Pharmacist
    participant Sys as Node.js HTTP Server
    database DB as SQLite Database

    %% Stage 1: Auth
    Note over Rec, Sys: 1. Authentication Stage
    Rec->>Sys: POST /api/auth/login (username, password)
    Sys->>DB: Query user credentials & verify hash
    DB-->>Sys: Return user record (Role: Receptionist)
    Sys-->>Rec: 200 OK (Set-Cookie: sgh_session, CSRF token)

    %% Stage 2: Patient Registration
    Note over Rec, Sys: 2. Patient Registration Stage
    Rec->>Sys: POST /api/patients (demographics, contact) [With Session & CSRF]
    Sys->>Sys: Validate fields (names, phone, email format)
    Sys->>DB: INSERT INTO patients (global_number, demographics)
    DB-->>Sys: Confirm insert (patient_id: 3, MRN: SGH-000003)
    Sys->>DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs (PATIENT_CREATED)
    Sys-->>Rec: 201 Created (MRN: SGH-000003)

    %% Stage 3: Appointment Booking (Success & Conflict Check)
    Note over Rec, Sys: 3. Appointment Booking & Conflict Prevention
    Rec->>Sys: POST /api/appointments (patient_id: 3, doctor_id: 2, start: 14:00, end: 14:30)
    Sys->>DB: Query appointments for Doctor 2 between 14:00 and 14:30
    DB-->>Sys: Return 0 matching rows (No overlap)
    Sys->>DB: INSERT INTO appointments
    DB-->>Sys: Confirm insert (appointment_id: 45)
    Sys-->>Rec: 201 Created (Appointment scheduled)

    Rec->>Sys: POST /api/appointments (patient_id: 4, doctor_id: 2, start: 14:15, end: 14:45)
    Sys->>DB: Query appointments for Doctor 2 between 14:15 and 14:45
    DB-->>Sys: Return 1 matching row (appointment_id: 45 overlaps!)
    Sys-->>Rec: 409 Conflict (Doctor is busy)

    %% Stage 4: Clinical Consultation
    Note over Doc, Sys: 4. Clinical Note & Lab Order Stage
    Doc->>Sys: POST /api/clinical-notes (patient_id: 3, note: "Patient exhibits symptoms...")
    Sys->>DB: INSERT INTO medical_records
    DB-->>Sys: Confirm insert
    Sys-->>Doc: 201 Created (Note appended)

    Doc->>Sys: POST /api/lab-orders (patient_id: 3, test_type: "Blood Panel")
    Sys->>DB: INSERT INTO lab_orders (status: PENDING)
    DB-->>Sys: Confirm insert (order_id: 12)
    Sys-->>Doc: 201 Created (Lab order placed)

    %% Stage 5: Lab Execution
    Note over Tech, Sys: 5. Lab Results Entry Stage
    Tech->>Sys: PATCH /api/lab-orders/12 (result: "Normal", status: COMPLETED)
    Sys->>DB: UPDATE lab_orders SET status = COMPLETED, INSERT INTO lab_results
    DB-->>Sys: Confirm updates
    Sys-->>Tech: 200 OK (Results recorded)

    %% Stage 6: Pharmacy Dispensing
    Note over Pharm, Sys: 6. Medication Dispense Stage
    Pharm->>Sys: POST /api/medications/dispense (patient_id: 3, medicine_id: 5, qty: 2)
    Sys->>DB: Query inventory balance for Medicine 5 (Batch A)
    DB-->>Sys: Return stock: 10, expiry: 2028-12-31
    Sys->>DB: UPDATE inventory (stock - 2) & INSERT INTO inventory_transactions
    DB-->>Sys: Confirm update
    Sys-->>Pharm: 200 OK (Dispensing recorded, stock updated)

    %% Stage 7: Invoicing
    Note over Rec, Sys: 7. Billing Stage
    Rec->>Sys: PATCH /api/invoices/99 (status: PAID)
    Sys->>DB: UPDATE invoices SET status = PAID, INSERT INTO payments
    DB-->>Sys: Confirm update
    Sys-->>Rec: 200 OK (Payment confirmed)

